WEBVTT

00:00.760 --> 00:03.560
♪Shrugging off past burdens♪

00:03.560 --> 00:06.150
♪Beneath the mask, who am I?♪

00:06.820 --> 00:10.220
♪Release and find wider shores♪

00:11.920 --> 00:14.930
♪Love's a riddle, and rain pours heavy♪

00:15.300 --> 00:17.830
♪Crossed paths, now downward fall♪

00:18.170 --> 00:21.610
♪From dust arises starlight's spark♪

00:23.360 --> 00:28.580
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

00:29.260 --> 00:34.340
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

00:35.140 --> 00:37.630
♪Let time's sails drift endlessly♪

00:37.630 --> 00:40.240
♪Through wandering exile♪

00:40.760 --> 00:48.020
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

00:48.990 --> 00:51.750
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

00:51.810 --> 00:54.650
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

00:54.940 --> 00:55.970
♪Let me♪

00:56.160 --> 01:00.240
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

01:00.690 --> 01:03.370
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

01:03.660 --> 01:06.360
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

01:06.530 --> 01:08.000
♪Hands held tight♪

01:08.000 --> 01:12.170
♪We forever live for love's sake♪

01:12.530 --> 01:22.780
♪Shadow's spear burns fiercely♪

01:24.210 --> 01:29.760
=Legend of The Female General=

01:59.190 --> 02:00.310
(Healing ointment?)

02:00.870 --> 02:01.950
(Who sent this?)

02:02.330 --> 02:05.260
=Episode 4=

02:08.110 --> 02:09.110
He's not only persistent,

02:10.150 --> 02:10.990
but also intelligent.

02:12.470 --> 02:14.150
What a formidable opponent.

02:14.750 --> 02:15.870
Anyway,

02:16.470 --> 02:18.230
He Yan is definitely no good.

02:18.950 --> 02:20.230
Shall I arrest him first?

02:20.790 --> 02:21.630
No rush.

02:22.590 --> 02:23.790
So you already have a plan?

02:24.350 --> 02:25.270
These recruits

02:25.829 --> 02:27.670
have trained for a full month.

02:28.030 --> 02:29.670
It's time for their banner competition.

02:30.790 --> 02:31.630
Then

02:32.310 --> 02:33.510
we'll see how it goes.

02:36.430 --> 02:38.430
Let me tell you a secret.

02:39.310 --> 02:41.070
Actually, besides me,

02:41.070 --> 02:42.950
someone anonymous
also bet on your victory.

02:42.950 --> 02:44.200
He got many flatbreads too.

02:44.590 --> 02:45.430
I bet it's either

02:46.829 --> 02:47.870
Huang Xiong or Mai.

02:48.829 --> 02:49.670
So you see,

02:50.190 --> 02:51.790
besides your best buddies,

02:51.790 --> 02:52.950
I'm your biggest supporter.

02:53.390 --> 02:54.350
So doesn't that

02:54.350 --> 02:55.390
make me your buddy, too?

02:57.390 --> 02:58.230
Yeah.

02:58.670 --> 02:59.510
It does.

02:59.829 --> 03:00.670
Of course.

03:01.190 --> 03:02.030
Mr. Cheng,

03:02.150 --> 03:03.140
may I ask you something?

03:03.510 --> 03:04.350
Go ahead.

03:05.230 --> 03:06.070
What are my chances

03:06.430 --> 03:07.950
of joining the Nine Banners Battalion,

03:08.150 --> 03:08.990
in your opinion?

03:11.310 --> 03:12.710
Given your talents,

03:13.430 --> 03:14.550
the chances are high.

03:15.590 --> 03:16.430
Really?

03:16.430 --> 03:17.270
Of course.

03:17.550 --> 03:18.790
But is it really necessary?

03:19.270 --> 03:20.110
Why not?

03:20.550 --> 03:21.510
You'll follow Xiao Jue

03:21.510 --> 03:22.550
into deadly missions.

03:22.630 --> 03:23.470
Didn't you know?

03:24.710 --> 03:25.550
Everybody knows

03:25.910 --> 03:27.470
that Xiao Jue may seem

03:27.470 --> 03:28.829
perfectly composed,

03:29.190 --> 03:30.310
but he loses it

03:30.310 --> 03:31.390
during battles.

03:31.829 --> 03:33.310
He Yan is still young.

03:33.310 --> 03:35.150
Why should he
risk his life with Xiao Jue?

03:35.150 --> 03:35.990
Totally.

03:35.990 --> 03:36.870
With his talents,

03:36.870 --> 03:37.750
I think

03:37.750 --> 03:39.300
he should follow a safer path...

03:40.990 --> 03:41.829
Where are you going?

03:42.470 --> 03:43.430
Be careful, it's hot.

03:43.430 --> 03:44.790
Dig in.

03:49.750 --> 03:50.710
He Yan, the recruit,

03:50.710 --> 03:51.820
is here to pay respect.

04:05.910 --> 04:06.790
You may enter.

04:16.630 --> 04:17.470
You need something?

04:18.230 --> 04:19.070
My buddies and I

04:19.070 --> 04:20.550
were celebrating my success...

04:20.550 --> 04:21.390
So?

04:22.870 --> 04:23.780
So I came here

04:23.780 --> 04:25.230
to thank you, Commander...

04:26.190 --> 04:27.030
No,

04:27.030 --> 04:27.910
Master.

04:28.520 --> 04:30.670
Thanks to your guidance and teachings,

04:30.670 --> 04:31.910
- I managed...
- Didn't you

04:32.350 --> 04:34.110
already express your gratitude?

04:36.670 --> 04:37.510
Commander,

04:37.630 --> 04:39.110
I won all thanks to you.

04:39.670 --> 04:41.350
I sincerely came to thank you.

04:41.830 --> 04:42.710
So please

04:45.350 --> 04:46.390
have this cup of tea.

05:00.510 --> 05:01.750
You don't like tea?

05:05.310 --> 05:06.190
How about

05:06.540 --> 05:07.630
some night snacks first?

05:07.630 --> 05:08.470
Stop.

05:17.450 --> 05:19.340
(Let me tell you a secret).

05:19.950 --> 05:21.230
(Actually, besides me,)

05:21.710 --> 05:23.560
(someone anonymous
also bet on your victory.)

05:23.690 --> 05:25.030
(He got many flatbreads too.)

05:31.870 --> 05:33.110
Mr. Cheng said

05:33.909 --> 05:34.750
that apart from him,

05:35.070 --> 05:37.110
someone anonymous also bet on me.

05:38.070 --> 05:39.210
So that person

05:42.190 --> 05:44.550
was you, Commander?

05:48.470 --> 05:49.950
You bet on me, too?

05:49.950 --> 05:51.390
So you have faith in me?

05:52.580 --> 05:53.420
Makes sense.

05:53.420 --> 05:55.590
After all, I was trained by you.

05:57.350 --> 05:58.670
Don't push it.

06:02.070 --> 06:02.910
Commander,

06:02.910 --> 06:03.750
look,

06:04.110 --> 06:05.950
since I won you so many flatbreads,

06:05.990 --> 06:07.790
shouldn't you give me some reward?

06:10.830 --> 06:11.670
Reward?

06:12.750 --> 06:13.790
What kind of reward?

06:15.390 --> 06:16.230
Commander.

06:16.550 --> 06:18.380
Am I qualified
for the Nine Banners Battalion?

06:21.510 --> 06:23.310
You only managed to beat two recruits.

06:24.070 --> 06:25.510
And now you dare ask

06:26.030 --> 06:27.870
to join the Nine Banners Battalion?

06:30.630 --> 06:31.470
Feel free

06:31.510 --> 06:33.030
to evaluate my performance.

06:33.470 --> 06:34.830
I won't let you down.

06:37.830 --> 06:38.670
Very well.

06:39.750 --> 06:41.030
Since you've said that,

06:42.230 --> 06:44.390
I'll make sure to evaluate you properly.

06:52.950 --> 06:54.820
A month has passed in your training.

06:56.230 --> 06:57.230
It's time for you

06:57.230 --> 06:58.510
to prove yourselves

06:59.670 --> 07:00.870
at the Flag Contest before

07:01.470 --> 07:02.500
the Mid-Autumn Festival.

07:03.950 --> 07:04.990
What does it mean?

07:06.390 --> 07:07.230
We'll place

07:08.030 --> 07:09.550
15 flags across Mount Baiyue

07:10.150 --> 07:11.510
for this contest.

07:12.150 --> 07:14.710
You'll be divided into different teams.

07:15.110 --> 07:16.470
Within the set timeframe,

07:16.870 --> 07:18.510
the team obtaining the most flags

07:19.030 --> 07:19.870
wins.

07:20.430 --> 07:21.750
The winning team will receive

07:22.030 --> 07:23.870
double this month's pay

07:24.270 --> 07:25.110
and double

07:25.430 --> 07:26.270
military merits.

07:26.310 --> 07:27.150
That's great.

07:27.150 --> 07:27.990
Awesome.

07:28.790 --> 07:30.430
But before the contest,

07:30.870 --> 07:32.350
you must patrol the mountains.

07:32.830 --> 07:33.670
Next,

07:34.230 --> 07:36.470
I'll assign you to different teams.

07:37.230 --> 07:38.430
- Zheng Xuan.
- Here!

07:38.430 --> 07:39.550
- Jiang Jiao.
- Here!

07:39.550 --> 07:40.940
- Wang Ba.
- Here!

07:41.380 --> 07:43.240
- He Yan.
- Here!

07:43.390 --> 07:44.900
- Mai.
- Here!

07:45.510 --> 07:46.550
You guys form one team.

07:47.190 --> 07:48.030
He Yan.

07:48.190 --> 07:49.230
You'll be the captain.

07:50.909 --> 07:51.750
Me?

07:54.390 --> 07:55.430
Starting tomorrow,

07:55.909 --> 07:56.830
patrol the mountains.

07:57.510 --> 07:58.350
Understood.

08:04.110 --> 08:05.750
(I've dug my own grave here.)

08:06.550 --> 08:08.230
(Xiao Jue is really)

08:08.230 --> 08:10.030
(putting me to the test.)

08:15.960 --> 08:17.770
(Captain)

08:33.190 --> 08:34.510
Horses get to rest and drink,

08:36.030 --> 08:37.630
while we keep patrolling.

08:55.990 --> 08:56.990
The flatbread is awful.

08:58.150 --> 08:59.500
Wang Ba.

08:59.500 --> 09:00.510
Want something tasty?

09:01.070 --> 09:01.910
What do you mean?

09:02.950 --> 09:04.230
Let's check ahead.

09:04.230 --> 09:05.070
There might be

09:05.390 --> 09:06.570
some rare fruits.

09:06.790 --> 09:07.630
I'll pick some.

09:07.630 --> 09:09.430
Or we can hunt for something.

09:11.790 --> 09:13.270
- Alright.
- Let's go.

09:13.270 --> 09:14.700
That's the mountain ridge ahead.

09:14.950 --> 09:15.790
The instructor

09:16.190 --> 09:17.110
forbids us to cross.

09:17.350 --> 09:19.030
Stay here if you're scared.

09:19.470 --> 09:20.310
We'll be right back.

09:20.590 --> 09:21.430
We're a team.

09:21.590 --> 09:22.710
We shouldn't split up.

09:22.710 --> 09:24.630
Also, do you know the terrain ahead?

09:25.750 --> 09:26.590
I...

09:27.030 --> 09:27.870
Wang Ba.

09:27.870 --> 09:28.710
Are we going?

09:29.350 --> 09:31.350
We'll be right back.

09:31.670 --> 09:34.070
We need something to eat.
The flatbread is tasteless.

09:34.150 --> 09:35.310
Here, take this.

09:36.110 --> 09:36.990
Let's go.

09:38.510 --> 09:39.350
He,

09:39.910 --> 09:40.990
let them be.

09:41.070 --> 09:43.150
Wang Ba lost to you.

09:43.670 --> 09:44.510
He feels humiliated

09:44.870 --> 09:45.710
to stay here.

09:45.990 --> 09:47.080
Let them be.

10:09.550 --> 10:10.390
He.

10:10.910 --> 10:12.590
What's taking them so long?

10:13.790 --> 10:14.630
They

10:15.390 --> 10:17.510
might've been taken by wild beasts.

10:19.050 --> 10:20.430
Bad news.

10:20.430 --> 10:21.270
We're in trouble!

10:23.710 --> 10:24.550
What happened?

10:24.990 --> 10:25.830
Where's Wang Ba?

10:26.030 --> 10:26.870
Hurry.

10:26.870 --> 10:27.710
Wang Ba was bitten

10:27.870 --> 10:28.710
by the wolves.

10:28.710 --> 10:29.550
Go rescue him.

10:30.750 --> 10:31.830
Look what you've done.

10:32.350 --> 10:33.540
Enough.

10:33.950 --> 10:34.910
Stop.

10:36.550 --> 10:37.430
Stop.

10:40.110 --> 10:40.950
He.

10:40.990 --> 10:41.830
Where are you going?

10:42.030 --> 10:42.870
Go back and get help.

10:42.870 --> 10:43.710
I'll find Wang Ba.

10:43.750 --> 10:44.990
It's too dangerous for you.

10:44.990 --> 10:45.830
He.

10:45.830 --> 10:47.110
It's easier like this. Hurry.

10:47.150 --> 10:47.990
Zheng Xuan.

10:48.230 --> 10:49.270
You brat!

10:49.870 --> 10:50.710
I...

10:50.870 --> 10:51.710
You...

11:40.470 --> 11:41.590
Don't let go.

11:47.350 --> 11:48.460
Wang Ba, are you okay?

11:48.710 --> 11:49.550
Why are you here?

11:49.550 --> 11:51.110
Forget it. Inform the instructor.

11:51.110 --> 11:53.350
- Go.
- You'll be alone...

11:53.350 --> 11:54.270
Stop nagging.

11:54.270 --> 11:55.390
Hurry up. I have a plan.

11:57.990 --> 11:58.830
Get up there.

11:59.470 --> 12:00.310
Hurry.

12:01.870 --> 12:03.150
You're courting death.

12:03.150 --> 12:03.990
Don't...

13:45.870 --> 13:47.870
I was once so much like you,

13:48.670 --> 13:50.150
blinded by false perceptions

13:50.950 --> 13:52.350
and ended up a puppet.

13:53.230 --> 13:54.430
Looking back now,

13:55.510 --> 13:56.350
my former self

13:57.630 --> 13:59.510
was just a trapped beast
fighting in vain.

14:08.910 --> 14:09.750
What did you say?

14:10.550 --> 14:11.550
He Yan ran away?

14:16.870 --> 14:17.710
I never expected

14:18.390 --> 14:19.230
that He Yan

14:20.230 --> 14:21.390
had planned to run away.

14:21.910 --> 14:23.590
He even urged us to run with him,

14:24.030 --> 14:25.110
saying that no one

14:25.470 --> 14:27.240
could reach us
once we crossed the mountain.

14:27.910 --> 14:29.030
As a loyal patriot,

14:29.590 --> 14:30.430
I naturally refused.

14:31.430 --> 14:32.270
Mr. Shen.

14:33.230 --> 14:34.070
Mr. Shen.

14:34.070 --> 14:35.990
Mai, Jiang Jiao, and Wang Ba are back.

15:41.310 --> 15:42.150
Zheng Xuan.

15:42.310 --> 15:43.150
How dare you lie?

15:43.310 --> 15:44.270
Have you no shame?

15:44.270 --> 15:45.130
I didn't...

15:45.130 --> 15:46.020
This petty loser

15:46.270 --> 15:47.990
set free all the horses before leaving.

15:47.990 --> 15:49.110
He meant for us to die.

15:49.470 --> 15:50.630
I'm telling the truth.

15:50.630 --> 15:51.670
Please do me justice.

15:51.670 --> 15:52.510
Mr. Shen.

15:55.310 --> 15:56.470
None of you dares

15:56.470 --> 15:58.150
to take the risk

15:58.150 --> 15:59.500
and rescue him.

16:00.070 --> 16:00.910
I'll go myself.

16:02.350 --> 16:04.070
I grew up in the mountains.

16:04.070 --> 16:05.910
I'm not afraid of wild beasts.

16:06.190 --> 16:07.510
I'll go alone.

16:17.470 --> 16:18.570
- Commander.
- Commander.

16:22.790 --> 16:23.630
Shen Han.

16:24.110 --> 16:24.950
Discipline them.

16:25.750 --> 16:26.590
Understood.

16:27.790 --> 16:29.310
Commander, should I search...

16:29.310 --> 16:30.150
No need.

16:30.670 --> 16:31.830
The terrain is treacherous.

16:31.830 --> 16:32.670
It's too risky.

16:32.990 --> 16:33.830
I'll go myself.

17:28.590 --> 17:30.310
This place isn't so bad.

17:47.190 --> 17:49.910
Maidens gaze at autumn's moon,
pleading for dexterity,

17:50.950 --> 17:53.430
threading countless crimson silks
till none remain.

17:56.950 --> 17:58.670
It's the Qixi Festival.

18:03.790 --> 18:05.710
But it's not all bad.

18:06.590 --> 18:07.430
After all,

18:08.310 --> 18:10.070
I have a dead wolf for company.

18:15.630 --> 18:16.470
What?

18:17.110 --> 18:18.590
Are you dreaming of sailing a boat

18:18.950 --> 18:20.110
with your sweetheart

18:20.550 --> 18:21.390
to celebrate Qixi?

18:22.670 --> 18:23.510
Commander?

18:23.590 --> 18:24.430
Com...

18:27.210 --> 18:28.190
Commander.

18:28.670 --> 18:29.590
How did you find me?

18:30.270 --> 18:31.150
Can you climb up?

18:33.270 --> 18:34.110
Commander.

18:34.750 --> 18:35.590
I can't.

18:40.430 --> 18:41.270
Commander.

18:43.070 --> 18:43.910
Commander.

19:11.620 --> 19:13.350
♪Constant yearning♪

19:13.820 --> 19:17.580
♪Still vivid as our first meeting♪

19:18.810 --> 19:20.810
♪Endless gazing♪

19:21.380 --> 19:23.560
♪Step by step, falling deeper♪

19:23.560 --> 19:24.490
Hold tight.

19:25.330 --> 19:27.210
♪How to untangle this love♪

19:27.480 --> 19:32.970
♪Buried deep within dreams♪

19:34.150 --> 19:39.400
♪My heart, unyielding as stone,
remains true♪

19:40.650 --> 19:44.780
♪Awaiting the crescent moon's
reflection in your heart♪

19:44.780 --> 19:47.560
♪Splendor fades from your eyes♪

19:48.050 --> 19:54.810
♪Crimson threads entwine like rings,
binding our first vow♪

19:54.900 --> 19:59.340
♪Time lingers as you and I share
overlapping palm lines♪

19:59.340 --> 20:03.230
♪Zither and harp
accompany our dancing dreams♪

20:03.730 --> 20:09.750
♪The brocade moon writes our vow,
keeping this promise♪

20:19.510 --> 20:20.350
Commander.

20:52.710 --> 20:54.390
You killed a wolf with your bare hands.

20:54.790 --> 20:55.630
Not only that,

20:56.190 --> 20:57.390
you helped others retreat

20:57.750 --> 20:58.990
in critical moments.

20:59.870 --> 21:01.150
Among all the recruits,

21:01.350 --> 21:03.780
none has shown such courage as you.

21:05.830 --> 21:07.430
Our lives were at stake.

21:07.990 --> 21:08.830
Commander.

21:08.830 --> 21:10.230
How could you bear to watch

21:10.470 --> 21:11.710
a promising warrior

21:12.070 --> 21:13.470
in his prime years

21:13.470 --> 21:14.390
meet the God of Death?

21:14.870 --> 21:15.830
Isn't it

21:16.710 --> 21:18.430
what you've taught us, Commander?

21:18.750 --> 21:19.590
So I've been

21:21.110 --> 21:22.670
pushing you to meet the God of Death?

21:25.750 --> 21:27.030
I wouldn't meet him.

21:27.510 --> 21:28.350
He is nowhere

21:28.750 --> 21:29.990
near as handsome as you.

21:38.070 --> 21:38.910
Commander.

21:39.620 --> 21:41.130
Are we heading back now?

21:41.510 --> 21:42.700
Want to spend the night here?

21:43.390 --> 21:44.230
No, no.

21:44.590 --> 21:45.930
I mean,

21:46.350 --> 21:47.390
there's no one else

21:48.030 --> 21:48.990
and only one horse.

21:49.390 --> 21:50.230
So?

21:52.710 --> 21:53.630
So,

21:55.110 --> 21:56.790
are you making me

21:58.070 --> 21:59.550
walk back, Commander?

22:04.310 --> 22:05.390
Oh my.

22:08.550 --> 22:10.070
What did I do wrong?

22:11.470 --> 22:13.270
What cruel fate is this?

22:17.190 --> 22:18.030
Get on the horse.

22:19.430 --> 22:20.270
Me?

22:21.310 --> 22:22.670
If you prefer walking back,

22:23.190 --> 22:24.070
I don't mind it.

22:25.030 --> 22:25.870
No, no.

22:25.870 --> 22:26.860
I can use a ride.

22:27.070 --> 22:27.980
I'm thrilled.

22:27.980 --> 22:28.950
Doesn't it hurt?

22:29.550 --> 22:30.750
It's just a minor injury.

22:35.990 --> 22:36.830
Wait.

22:37.630 --> 22:38.470
What now?

22:39.390 --> 22:40.230
Commander.

22:40.630 --> 22:41.710
Look at that wolf.

22:42.350 --> 22:44.190
I went through great effort to kill it.

22:44.710 --> 22:46.020
Isn't it a shame

22:46.020 --> 22:47.510
to leave it here?

22:49.070 --> 22:49.910
What do you propose?

22:50.510 --> 22:51.470
How about

22:52.350 --> 22:53.910
taking it with us?

22:55.670 --> 22:56.510
Approved.

22:56.910 --> 22:57.830
Really?

22:58.270 --> 22:59.910
Commander, you're such a kind soul.

23:00.110 --> 23:00.950
Put it on the horse.

23:01.510 --> 23:02.350
And you get off.

23:04.310 --> 23:05.150
Forget it.

23:30.270 --> 23:31.110
Commander.

23:31.670 --> 23:33.070
I just wanted to feel your sword.

23:33.350 --> 23:34.830
I didn't get the chance last time.

23:36.630 --> 23:37.470
Nice sword.

23:37.510 --> 23:38.790
What a great sword.

23:39.310 --> 23:40.230
You could be silent.

23:42.310 --> 23:43.150
But Commander,

23:43.430 --> 23:45.420
I'll die of boredom if I don't talk.

23:52.310 --> 23:53.150
Commander.

23:53.350 --> 23:55.110
You don't need to be so serious.

23:55.670 --> 23:56.510
Think about it.

23:56.830 --> 23:58.430
I killed a wolf

23:58.430 --> 23:59.270
but didn't take it.

23:59.430 --> 24:01.190
Wouldn't that just benefit the foxes?

24:02.430 --> 24:03.270
Let alone the meat,

24:03.870 --> 24:05.350
even the fur is top quality.

24:06.150 --> 24:07.390
It makes excellent cloaks.

24:08.270 --> 24:09.110
Of course,

24:09.110 --> 24:10.310
you'd consider it beneath you.

24:10.310 --> 24:11.670
Which means I get the advantage.

24:12.230 --> 24:14.630
If I had a wolf-fur cloak,

24:14.910 --> 24:15.750
I could

24:15.750 --> 24:17.390
roll around in the snow in winter.

24:18.710 --> 24:19.790
You sound obsessed.

24:20.390 --> 24:22.230
No wonder you clung to that dead wolf

24:22.630 --> 24:23.790
in the pit earlier.

24:24.670 --> 24:25.510
That's not it.

24:26.150 --> 24:27.350
I was just freezing.

24:28.710 --> 24:29.550
I know

24:29.550 --> 24:30.390
you value hygiene

24:30.590 --> 24:31.430
and detest filth.

24:31.670 --> 24:33.110
You'd never let an animal's blood

24:33.390 --> 24:34.510
taint your robes.

24:35.110 --> 24:36.470
But I'm different.

24:37.190 --> 24:38.070
Let alone dead wolves,

24:38.670 --> 24:40.150
I've even lain among corpses.

24:42.670 --> 24:43.510
When?

24:54.190 --> 24:55.310
Well...

24:55.310 --> 24:57.350
That was a long time ago.

25:00.390 --> 25:02.550
My hometown suffered poor harvests

25:02.870 --> 25:03.950
back in the day.

25:04.310 --> 25:05.670
People were starving.

25:06.070 --> 25:07.230
And so many died.

25:09.060 --> 25:10.310
As for the details,

25:10.310 --> 25:11.510
I can't recall clearly.

25:26.270 --> 25:27.510
This Qixi Festival

25:28.390 --> 25:30.150
is truly unforgettable.

25:58.750 --> 25:59.590
(A woman?)

26:04.430 --> 26:05.350
(Why did a woman)

26:06.190 --> 26:07.710
(come all the way to Yezhou)

26:08.670 --> 26:09.510
(to join)

26:09.910 --> 26:10.980
(the army?)

26:25.740 --> 26:29.930
(Yezhou Garrison)

26:29.930 --> 26:33.830
(Yezhou Garrison)

26:41.310 --> 26:42.150
Commander.

26:42.150 --> 26:42.990
Commander.

26:47.710 --> 26:48.550
He Yan.

26:49.550 --> 26:50.390
He Yan.

27:00.670 --> 27:01.510
Well...

27:01.710 --> 27:02.550
Commander, I...

27:02.550 --> 27:03.390
Get off now.

27:04.150 --> 27:05.150
Shen Han, get him down.

27:05.910 --> 27:07.510
Have Cheng Lisu tend to his wounds.

27:08.350 --> 27:09.190
Understood.

27:11.230 --> 27:12.990
That sharp tongue with a tender heart...

27:13.190 --> 27:14.590
You haven't changed one bit.

27:14.950 --> 27:15.790
What did you say?

27:18.150 --> 27:18.990
Nothing.

27:19.470 --> 27:20.310
Nothing.

27:20.310 --> 27:21.150
Come on, He Yan.

27:21.430 --> 27:22.270
Come on.

27:28.110 --> 27:29.150
So badly injured?

27:34.110 --> 27:34.950
You got this?

27:34.950 --> 27:36.070
- Yeah.
- Take it easy.

27:36.070 --> 27:37.310
Commander, you're back.

27:38.630 --> 27:39.790
How is He Yan doing?

27:39.790 --> 27:40.630
Still breathing.

27:41.310 --> 27:42.350
He had killed the wolf

27:42.910 --> 27:43.870
by the time I found him.

27:45.030 --> 27:46.870
He killed a wolf on his own?

27:47.430 --> 27:48.990
We can't underestimate this kid.

27:49.630 --> 27:50.670
Indeed,

27:51.710 --> 27:52.750
we can't.

27:54.110 --> 27:55.190
He Yan risked his life

27:55.430 --> 27:56.420
to save the others.

27:56.950 --> 27:58.430
A spy wouldn't have done that.

27:59.310 --> 28:00.190
Does this mean

28:00.230 --> 28:01.190
he's off the hook?

28:02.110 --> 28:02.950
Not just yet.

28:04.350 --> 28:05.190
Commander.

28:05.550 --> 28:06.470
What about Zheng Xuan?

28:10.030 --> 28:12.510
Soldiers may fall by enemy blades,

28:13.110 --> 28:15.590
but never to friendly fire.

28:16.870 --> 28:17.710
Zheng Xuan

28:19.190 --> 28:20.030
shall be executed.

28:21.030 --> 28:21.870
Understood.

28:26.710 --> 28:27.550
What?

28:27.910 --> 28:29.070
Zheng Xuan was executed?

28:32.950 --> 28:34.830
(Xiao Jue is truly strict
with his troops.)

28:35.190 --> 28:36.030
Put up with it.

28:36.030 --> 28:36.870
Here we go.

28:37.470 --> 28:38.310
What about

28:39.070 --> 28:39.910
the others?

28:40.750 --> 28:42.190
Wang Ba crossed the ridge.

28:42.190 --> 28:43.550
Twenty lashes are inevitable.

28:44.230 --> 28:45.950
Jiang Jiao and Mai didn't commit

28:45.950 --> 28:47.020
major offenses,

28:47.470 --> 28:48.310
but Huaijin said

28:48.630 --> 28:50.030
that they must be punished

28:50.030 --> 28:50.870
with ten lashes each

28:51.150 --> 28:52.910
as a warning for abandoning

28:52.910 --> 28:53.750
a fellow soldier.

28:58.710 --> 28:59.780
Do you also think

29:00.110 --> 29:00.950
that Huaijin

29:01.270 --> 29:02.410
is a bit too cruel?

29:02.950 --> 29:04.420
I'm not defending him.

29:04.870 --> 29:05.710
But I believe

29:05.790 --> 29:06.630
he actually...

29:06.630 --> 29:08.430
The army has inviolable rules.

29:09.790 --> 29:10.630
Zheng Xuan broke

29:10.830 --> 29:11.670
military discipline

29:12.190 --> 29:13.310
and violated brotherhood.

29:13.830 --> 29:15.070
If we ever go to war,

29:15.430 --> 29:16.910
who'd trust him to guard their back?

29:17.870 --> 29:19.510
Yezhou Garrison needs reconstruction.

29:20.390 --> 29:22.190
The Commander aims to make an example

29:22.470 --> 29:23.400
to restore discipline.

29:24.110 --> 29:24.950
Although

29:25.630 --> 29:27.710
the execution is brutal,

29:28.310 --> 29:30.350
it's a necessary deterrent.

29:30.950 --> 29:31.790
The Commander

29:32.190 --> 29:33.230
must have decided that

29:33.350 --> 29:34.570
after careful consideration.

29:35.230 --> 29:36.830
For a recruit, you surprisingly

29:37.070 --> 29:38.230
grasp military principles

29:38.750 --> 29:39.790
like a commander does.

29:40.110 --> 29:41.670
I intend to become a general.

29:41.870 --> 29:43.030
Naturally, I know more.

29:45.870 --> 29:46.710
That makes sense.

29:49.030 --> 29:49.870
Take off your shirt.

29:52.390 --> 29:53.230
What?

29:53.550 --> 29:54.750
Why are you so surprised?

29:55.270 --> 29:56.110
As if you're a girl.

29:56.950 --> 29:58.390
If it weren't for our friendship

29:58.630 --> 29:59.790
and Huaijin's request,

30:00.350 --> 30:01.590
as a gynecology expert,

30:02.270 --> 30:03.350
why would I treat a man?

30:03.870 --> 30:04.910
I don't need your help.

30:05.350 --> 30:06.190
I can dress

30:06.470 --> 30:07.310
my wounds.

30:08.350 --> 30:09.790
Why are you suddenly shy?

30:10.390 --> 30:11.230
Are you hiding

30:11.270 --> 30:12.650
something unspeakable?

30:15.270 --> 30:16.510
Don't be ashamed.

30:16.510 --> 30:17.990
Let me examine you.

30:17.990 --> 30:19.820
Actually, I

30:21.030 --> 30:21.870
have a fiancée.

30:22.390 --> 30:23.530
I'm only intimate with her.

30:24.270 --> 30:25.110
Mr. He.

30:25.110 --> 30:26.270
You're so conservative.

30:27.070 --> 30:28.580
But you need medical treatment.

30:28.580 --> 30:30.350
Your fiancée won't mind.

30:30.670 --> 30:31.510
Come on.

30:38.710 --> 30:40.030
I thought you were only intimate

30:40.350 --> 30:41.310
with your fiancée.

30:43.550 --> 30:44.550
Mr. He.

30:44.550 --> 30:45.990
Why did you hit me on my face?

30:45.990 --> 30:47.030
You'd ruin my looks.

30:48.030 --> 30:49.190
My apologies.

30:50.870 --> 30:52.190
Let him preserve his virtue

30:52.190 --> 30:53.310
for his fiancée.

30:54.510 --> 30:55.430
Don't expose anything

30:56.230 --> 30:57.310
and let your fiancée down.

31:07.790 --> 31:08.630
Mr. He,

31:08.950 --> 31:10.510
you've earned Huaijin's recognition.

31:11.030 --> 31:11.910
How so?

31:13.150 --> 31:14.630
This healing ointment is precious.

31:15.070 --> 31:16.750
Huaijin hardly uses it himself.

31:17.270 --> 31:18.110
For years,

31:18.190 --> 31:19.590
he's only given it to two people.

31:19.790 --> 31:20.630
One is you.

31:20.910 --> 31:21.750
The other was...

31:22.630 --> 31:23.470
An ungrateful wretch.

31:24.510 --> 31:25.350
Ungrateful wretch?

31:26.150 --> 31:26.990
Never mind.

31:27.390 --> 31:28.230
Don't be like him.

31:28.830 --> 31:29.670
Who is he?

31:30.270 --> 31:31.950
None other than He Rufei.

31:32.350 --> 31:33.710
You're talking about me...

31:34.060 --> 31:35.070
He Rufei?

31:35.830 --> 31:36.670
That's right.

31:43.670 --> 31:44.870
The current He Rufei

31:45.350 --> 31:46.550
is an ungrateful wretch.

31:47.150 --> 31:48.830
But the former He Rufei

31:49.230 --> 31:50.220
wasn't.

32:16.630 --> 32:17.470
It's him.

32:18.070 --> 32:19.110
Could he be...

32:22.390 --> 32:23.870
False of heart?

32:26.030 --> 32:28.150
Men's thoughts are inscrutable.

32:28.390 --> 32:29.630
I still don't know him

32:30.350 --> 32:31.190
well enough.

32:35.030 --> 32:36.830
(What exactly did Xiao Jue go through)

32:37.950 --> 32:40.830
(to employ
such brutal military discipline?)

33:06.950 --> 33:07.790
Master.

33:08.750 --> 33:10.030
I came today

33:10.710 --> 33:12.790
to light a perpetual lamp

33:13.710 --> 33:15.430
for my stepsister He Yan.

33:15.990 --> 33:17.870
Amitabha.

33:18.350 --> 33:19.630
But this lamp

33:20.070 --> 33:21.150
is rather different

33:21.990 --> 33:22.830
from the others.

33:23.990 --> 33:26.510
What kind of lamp do you want, General?

33:28.550 --> 33:29.590
(This lamp)

33:30.430 --> 33:32.630
(must suppress her spirit.)

33:36.630 --> 33:38.390
They say Xiao Huaijin

33:38.750 --> 33:42.270
is thriving in Yezhou.

33:42.870 --> 33:44.550
The recruits he trained

33:44.710 --> 33:46.990
are showing great promise.

33:48.830 --> 33:50.270
Yezhou Garrison's supplies

33:50.670 --> 33:52.390
are controlled
by the Yezhou County Office.

33:53.350 --> 33:54.830
If I recall correctly,

33:55.310 --> 33:57.030
Yezhou Magistrate Sun Xiangfu

33:57.630 --> 33:58.910
is also your disciple.

34:02.550 --> 34:04.270
Though he works for me,

34:05.150 --> 34:06.630
distance breeds

34:07.710 --> 34:09.909
delusions of local kingship.

34:11.469 --> 34:14.590
He's developed improper ambitions.

34:15.150 --> 34:17.190
Do you have concerns?

34:17.909 --> 34:19.670
I once helped him,

34:19.870 --> 34:21.550
and he repaid favors,

34:22.150 --> 34:23.530
leading to

34:23.830 --> 34:25.750
financial exchanges.

34:26.350 --> 34:28.150
But being petty-minded,

34:28.750 --> 34:31.190
he likely kept secret records.

34:32.389 --> 34:34.070
Chancellor, Mr. Chu.

34:34.190 --> 34:35.190
General Feihong is here.

34:35.790 --> 34:36.630
He Rufei?

34:37.290 --> 34:39.400
He's always stayed neutral,

34:39.400 --> 34:40.310
away from trouble.

34:40.790 --> 34:42.219
But he suddenly visits today...

34:43.630 --> 34:44.469
Zilan.

34:45.590 --> 34:48.350
I am rather weary today.

34:48.670 --> 34:50.030
Entertain our guest.

34:50.310 --> 34:51.150
Understood.

35:00.870 --> 35:01.830
General Feihong.

35:02.950 --> 35:03.790
I truly admire you.

35:04.430 --> 35:05.950
It's such an honor

35:05.950 --> 35:06.790
for me

35:06.790 --> 35:08.430
to witness your noble bearing.

35:08.990 --> 35:10.270
You flatter me, Mr. Chu.

35:10.830 --> 35:11.670
I'm just lucky

35:11.670 --> 35:13.630
to have cured the scars on my face

35:13.750 --> 35:15.140
and stopped wearing the mask.

35:15.140 --> 35:16.510
General, please.

35:21.390 --> 35:22.230
Mr. Chu.

35:22.630 --> 35:24.310
Where is the Chancellor?

35:24.990 --> 35:26.470
Occupied with official matters,

35:26.470 --> 35:28.230
he asked me to host you on his behalf.

35:28.950 --> 35:30.180
I hope you won't

35:30.180 --> 35:31.230
take offense.

35:32.790 --> 35:35.710
The Chancellor handles myriad affairs.
Of course, he is busy.

35:35.710 --> 35:38.270
But you seem quite at leisure, Mr. Chu.

35:38.670 --> 35:41.130
You're serving tea
in the Chancellor's mansion

35:41.130 --> 35:43.020
and learning to be a host.

35:43.830 --> 35:44.990
The art of tea

35:45.350 --> 35:47.270
nurtures the spirit

35:47.790 --> 35:49.950
and honors guests.

35:50.390 --> 35:52.150
Didn't you come

35:52.470 --> 35:54.120
to visit the Chancellor

35:54.590 --> 35:55.910
for this very cup of tea?

35:58.230 --> 36:01.470
As sharp-tongued as you are,

36:01.710 --> 36:02.550
I suppose

36:02.630 --> 36:04.230
you also make excellent tea.

36:04.470 --> 36:06.870
That's why the Chancellor values you so.

36:10.310 --> 36:11.150
Ding Yi.

36:12.110 --> 36:14.730
I recently acquired
a rare hydraulics manuscript

36:14.730 --> 36:16.110
and brought it to Mr. Xu.

36:16.110 --> 36:17.630
(Hydraulics book)
Since he is occupied,

36:17.630 --> 36:20.780
may I trouble you to deliver it to him?

36:21.710 --> 36:22.710
My pleasure.

36:25.310 --> 36:26.150
Farewell.

36:32.110 --> 36:33.550
(He Rufei's guard)

36:34.430 --> 36:36.470
(seems remarkably skilled.)

36:42.790 --> 36:43.630
Zilan.

36:43.670 --> 36:44.510
Sit.

36:44.510 --> 36:45.350
Understood.

36:50.910 --> 36:52.150
What do you think

36:52.150 --> 36:54.670
of He Rufei?

36:54.670 --> 36:56.270
I'm not sure if he's being fake

36:56.270 --> 36:57.540
or just overrated,

36:57.790 --> 36:58.710
but he's not exactly

36:59.070 --> 37:00.270
how people described him.

37:03.630 --> 37:06.710
You strike true to the core.

37:07.310 --> 37:08.150
However,

37:08.590 --> 37:10.410
he does possess merits.

37:12.270 --> 37:13.190
Aren't you

37:13.190 --> 37:14.790
concerned about Yezhou Garrison?

37:15.350 --> 37:16.190
I think

37:16.510 --> 37:17.700
his arrival proves timely.

37:18.270 --> 37:19.110
He has

37:19.190 --> 37:20.270
an exceptional guard.

37:21.230 --> 37:22.510
If we get them to join us,

37:23.190 --> 37:24.270
we can take down Xiao Jue

37:24.870 --> 37:26.070
and get rid of

37:26.230 --> 37:27.190
the Sun family.

37:28.750 --> 37:29.590
Very well.

37:30.310 --> 37:32.870
Since you've devised a plan,

37:33.150 --> 37:34.280
I'll entrust

37:34.430 --> 37:35.990
this matter to you.

37:37.150 --> 37:37.990
Understood.

37:38.170 --> 37:40.300
(Hydraulics book)

37:40.300 --> 37:43.780
(Chu Mansion)

37:51.710 --> 37:52.550
Father.

37:53.370 --> 37:55.270
(Lord Shijin, Chu Linfeng)

37:56.990 --> 37:58.350
How is the Chancellor?

37:58.910 --> 38:01.030
Why didn't he ask you
to stay for dinner?

38:01.630 --> 38:02.470
He is well,

38:03.310 --> 38:04.420
just busy with work.

38:04.750 --> 38:05.590
I dare not

38:05.710 --> 38:06.550
disrupt him.

38:08.150 --> 38:09.150
Oh, you...

38:09.150 --> 38:10.470
How many times have I told you?

38:10.950 --> 38:13.030
Stay by the Chancellor's side.

38:13.350 --> 38:14.430
Strengthen your bond.

38:14.750 --> 38:15.590
That's how

38:15.590 --> 38:17.070
he'll value you in the future.

38:18.790 --> 38:19.630
Forget it.

38:20.870 --> 38:22.430
I must attend a banquet.

38:22.430 --> 38:23.270
Dine with your mother

38:23.670 --> 38:25.230
in the inner chambers.

38:25.230 --> 38:26.070
Understood.

38:38.070 --> 38:39.240
(Sunlight bears auspiciousness)
Greetings, Mother.

38:39.710 --> 38:41.590
Father sent me to dine with you.

38:43.270 --> 38:45.110
(Wife of Lord Shijin)
I have no appetite.

38:45.110 --> 38:46.470
I'll retire early.

38:47.110 --> 38:47.950
Dine alone.

38:50.110 --> 38:50.950
Understood.

38:52.790 --> 38:54.390
Stop acting like you are

38:54.990 --> 38:56.230
Lingfeng's biological son.

38:58.510 --> 38:59.350
Your mother

38:59.630 --> 39:01.070
might have been Miss Chu,

39:01.510 --> 39:02.550
but nobody knows

39:02.790 --> 39:03.830
who your father is.

39:04.350 --> 39:06.310
Your uncle adopted you, who was born

39:06.310 --> 39:07.590
to an unknown father

39:07.710 --> 39:08.910
for the family's reputation.

39:09.510 --> 39:11.150
Don't you want

39:11.150 --> 39:12.110
your shameless mother,

39:12.390 --> 39:13.830
who bore a child out of wedlock,

39:13.830 --> 39:14.990
to enter the ancestral hall?

39:16.150 --> 39:19.150
Then you'd better
work harder to elevate your status.

39:32.430 --> 39:33.270
Draw.

39:34.340 --> 39:35.190
Turn.

39:36.870 --> 39:37.710
Uppercut.

39:38.430 --> 39:39.270
Thrust.

39:39.990 --> 39:40.830
Stab.

39:42.510 --> 39:43.350
Commander.

39:46.710 --> 39:47.670
You dug so much

39:48.510 --> 39:49.430
into his past,

39:49.430 --> 39:50.270
but to no avail?

39:50.750 --> 39:51.590
That's right.

39:51.910 --> 39:54.030
Everything matches his military records.

39:54.830 --> 39:55.670
Perhaps He Yan

39:55.670 --> 39:56.550
has nothing to do

39:56.590 --> 39:57.740
with He Rufei and Xu Jingfu.

39:59.470 --> 40:00.310
This only proves

40:00.550 --> 40:02.670
those covering for him
are remarkably capable.

40:03.790 --> 40:04.870
Covering for him?

40:05.670 --> 40:06.750
Did you discover something?

40:09.470 --> 40:10.470
An unexpected lead.

40:11.390 --> 40:12.310
Keep looking.

40:13.190 --> 40:14.030
Understood.

40:15.110 --> 40:17.270
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

40:17.370 --> 40:21.290
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

40:21.470 --> 40:23.410
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

40:23.500 --> 40:28.430
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

40:40.530 --> 40:41.940
♪I've seen the mountains♪

40:42.140 --> 40:43.550
♪And trodden through ice♪

40:43.820 --> 40:46.630
♪Day after day, I venture alone♪

40:46.940 --> 40:48.330
♪Destiny is my creed♪

40:48.390 --> 40:49.790
♪Ideals surge beneath the surface♪

40:49.940 --> 40:51.730
♪Igniting the flame against the winds♪

40:52.930 --> 40:54.400
♪A restless yearning in my soul♪

40:54.570 --> 40:55.860
♪Gazing through the mire♪

40:56.040 --> 40:58.430
♪Who cares about this boundless void♪

40:58.630 --> 41:00.680
♪Charge ahead with blazing fervor♪

41:01.810 --> 41:03.640
♪Stubbornly fighting with my life♪

41:05.600 --> 41:08.520
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

41:08.610 --> 41:11.270
♪There must always be a longing♪

41:11.730 --> 41:16.790
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

41:17.120 --> 41:19.130
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

41:19.440 --> 41:23.090
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

41:23.330 --> 41:25.220
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

41:25.250 --> 41:29.100
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

41:29.450 --> 41:31.390
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

41:31.570 --> 41:35.400
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

41:35.650 --> 41:41.400
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

41:42.290 --> 41:47.760
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪

41:54.920 --> 41:57.840
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

41:57.920 --> 42:00.590
♪There must always be a longing♪

42:01.040 --> 42:06.100
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

42:06.440 --> 42:08.450
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

42:08.760 --> 42:12.410
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

42:12.640 --> 42:14.530
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

42:14.560 --> 42:18.410
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

42:18.760 --> 42:20.700
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

42:20.890 --> 42:24.710
